ted":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hello, thank you very much for you really interesting work ! \n\nIs it planned to release the model weights?\n\nUpdate : I've found a model [here](https://huggingface.co/SkyDiff1109/SkyDiffusion_ckpt/tree/main) which i supposed is trained but the resulting aerial images makes me feel that it dont \n\nGT\n![GT](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/da942ae3-6fc8-472d-b3c2-8dfae1fa7a69)\nPRED\n![PRED](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/545d9046-fc83-4ff6-badd-518786ff9c96)\nBEV\n![BEV](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1a0e6a99-34d5-4a66-aefe-e7a2fe1d2f4b)\n\n\nAssuming my BEV is right i guess it's really related to the current ckpt i'm using.\n\nAlso i had to make some fixes in the code to have it running correctly i can raise a PR if you are interested\n\nThank you ","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatalab/skydiffusion/issues/4/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatalab/skydiffusion/issues/4/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatalab/skydiffusion/issues/3","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatalab/skydiffusion","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatalab/skydiffusion/issues/3/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatalab/skydiffusion/issues/3/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatalab/skydiffusion/issues/3/events","html_url":"https://github.com/opendatalab/skydiffusion/issues/3","id":2943546333,"node_id":"I_kwDOMgbKCs6vcvPd","number":3,"title":"Release SkyDiffusion model checkpoint on Hugging Face","user":{"login":"NielsRogge","id":48327001,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MzI3MDAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48327001?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NielsRogge","html_url":"https://github.com/NielsRogge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NielsRogge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NielsRogge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NielsRogge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NielsRogge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NielsRogge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NielsRogge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NielsRogge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NielsRogge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NielsRogge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-03-24T15:00:34Z","updated_at":"2025-03-24T15:00:34Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi @RedShallot 🤗\n\nNiels here from the open-source team at Hugging Face. I discovered your work on Arxiv and was wondering whether you would like to submit it to [hf.co/papers](https://hf.co/papers) to improve its discoverability.If you are one of the authors, you can submit it at https://huggingface.co/papers/submit.\n\nThe paper page lets people discuss about your paper and lets them find artifacts about it (your models, datasets or demo for instance), you can also claim\nthe paper as yours which will show up on your public profile at HF, add Github and project page URLs.\n\nIt'd be great to make the SkyDiffusion model checkpoints available on the 🤗 hub, to improve their discoverability/visibility.\nWe can add tags so that people find them when filtering https://huggingface.co/models.\n\nI see you have already released the dataset G2A-3 on the Hugging Face hub, which is great.\n\n## Uploading models\n\nSee here for a guide: https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/models-uploading. \n\nIn this case, we could leverage the [PyTorchModelHubMixin](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/package_reference/mixins#huggingface_hub.PyTorchModelHubMixin) class which adds `from_pretrained` and `push_to_hub` to any custom `nn.Module`. Alternatively, one can leverages the [hf_hub_download](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/en/guides/download#download-a-single-file) one-liner to download a checkpoint from the hub. \n\nWe encourage researchers to push each model checkpoint to a separate model repository, so that things like download stats also work. We can then also link the checkpoints to the paper page.\n\nLet me know if you're interested/need any help regarding this!\n\nCheers,\n\nNiels\nML Engineer @ HF 🤗","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatalab/skydiffusion/issues/3/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatalab/skydiffusion/issues/3/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatalab/skydiffusion/issues/2","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatalab/skydiffusion","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatalab/skydiffusion/issues/2/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatalab/skydiffusion/issues/2/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatalab/skydiffusion/issues/2/events","html_url":"https://github.com/opendatalab/skydiffusion/issues/2","id":2746595823,"node_id":"I_kwDOMgbKCs6jtbnv","number":2,"title":"Train.py release","user":{"login":"PaulLiuYZ",